    "answer": "to{} separate/part/divide/keep-apart",
    "mnemonic": "Remember how <ja>離れる</ja> is \"to separate,\" where something is just separating and you're not doing the separating? Well, this one has the same meaning, but now you're doing the separating. This word is <ja>離す</ja>, and you know that you're doing the separating because if you don't, that person will <reading>sue</reading> (<ja>す</ja>) you for grabbing onto them and not letting go.",
    "readingMnemonic": "The reading comes from <ja>離れる</ja>."
